Look at the picture and say the word before I do!

23
00:01:01.283 --> 00:01:03.494
What is it? Can you say it?

24
00:01:06.394 --> 00:01:08.420
Tall! Well done!

25
00:01:09.417 --> 00:01:11.535
What is it? Can you say it?

26
00:01:14.435 --> 00:01:16.797
Fat! Well done!

27
00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:20.412
What is it? Can you say it?

28
00:01:23.312 --> 00:01:25.291
Short! Well done!

29
00:01:26.283 --> 00:01:29.017
What is it? Can you say it?

30
00:01:31.917 --> 00:01:33.733
Little! Well done!

31
00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.493
Say each word as fast as you can.

32
00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:44.571
